            "value": "<p>Your benefactor's blood flows through your veins, and you channel their power into your body. When you critically hit with an unarmed Strike, the target takes an additional 1 persistent damage of the same type as the damage dealt by the breath of your draconic benefactor.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.journals.JournalEntry.kzxu2dI7tFxv6Ix6.JournalEntryPage.GduFISQ6kzEB6sec#draconic-benefactors]{Draconic Benefactors}</p>"
