          "description": {
            "value": "<p>You convince your foe you're less of a threat. You attempt to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Feint] against a creature. Unlike a normal Feint, the creature can be within 30 feet instead of in your melee reach, and you make your check against its Will DC instead of its Perception DC.</p>"
