    {
      "fileName": "kobold-momentum.json",
      "id": "pXwOIzZhfgJrhQxS",
      "name": "Kobold Momentum",
      "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
      "type": "feat",
      "data": {
        "_id": "pXwOIzZhfgJrhQxS",
        "folder": "UUTk1SFVEqGhW5le",
        "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
        "name": "Kobold Momentum",
        "system": {
          "actionType": {
            "value": "passive"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": null
          },
          "category": "ancestry",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>You possess the confidence of a dragon, and your success emboldens you to draw on power reserves you didn't know you had. You recharge your Kobold Breath whenever you score a critical hit with a Strike. In addition, if you score a critical hit with a Strike and then use your Kobold Breath on the same turn, you can reroll any 1s on the damage dice. You must use the new result, even if it's a 1.</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 5
          },
          "prerequisites": {
            "value": [
              {
                "value": "Kobold Breath"
              }
            ]
          },
          "publication": {
