    {
      "fileName": "snare-genius.json",
      "id": "8DIzXO1YpsU3DpJw",
      "name": "Snare Genius",
      "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
      "type": "feat",
      "data": {
        "_id": "8DIzXO1YpsU3DpJw",
        "folder": "UUTk1SFVEqGhW5le",
        "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
        "name": "Snare Genius",
        "system": {
          "actionType": {
            "value": "passive"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": null
          },
          "category": "ancestry",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>If the snare normally takes 1 minute to Craft, you can Craft it with 3 Interact actions instead. Each day during your daily preparations, you can prepare three snares from your formula book for quick deployment (increasing to four snares if you're a master in Crafting and five if you're legendary). Snares prepared in this way don't cost you any resources to Craft.</p>\n<p>When a creature critically fails its saving throw against and takes damage from the initial effect of a snare you Crafted and deployed, that creature is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Off-Guard] until the end of its next turn.</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 5
          },
          "prerequisites": {
            "value": [
              {
                "value": "expert in Crafting"
              },
              {
                "value": "Snare Crafting"
              }
            ]
          },
          "publication": {
            "license": "ORC",
            "remaster": true,
            "title": "Pathfinder Player Core 2"
          },
          "rules": [
            {
              "craftableItems": [
                "item:trait:snare"
              ],
              "isPrepared": true,
              "key": "CraftingAbility",
              "maxSlots": "1 + @actor.system.skills.crafting.rank",
              "priority": 60,
              "slug": "snare-genius"
            }
          ],
          "traits": {
            "rarity": "common",
            "value": [
              "kobold"
            ]
          }
        },
        "type": "feat"
      },
      "level": 5,
      "category": "ancestry"
    },
    {
      "fileName": "tip-the-scales.json",
      "id": "Dc5hLCC2qxCDWjX5",
      "name": "Tip the Scales",
      "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
      "type": "feat",
